<report>
<title>Two sample Smirnov test for distribution difference</title>

<p>X sample: @x<br />
Y sample: @y</p>

<p>Two sided test:<br />
D = @{d:roundu}<br />
<pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>

<p>One sided test (suspecting @sample_1 shifted left of @sample_2):<br />
D = @{d_l:roundu}<br />
<pval>@{p_l:pval}</pval></p>

<p>One sided test (suspecting @sample_1 shifted right of @sample_2):<br />
D = @{d_r:roundu}<br />
<pval>@{p_r:pval}</pval></p>
</report>
